<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.2.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02358</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.2.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>d40e693e-713c-468e-be9a-e21818245efe</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="practice" id="sect-00001">
      <para id="para-00001">Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
      <para id="para-00002">For questions 1 - 5, the standard form of an equation is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>. For each expression, find the missing constant <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> that would make the expression a perfect square.</para>
      <exercise id="_74779890-74be-4c6e-abac-e9c6c8418736" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00004">Correct! 9 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
          <para id="para-00005">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00006">The correct answer is: 9 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="aff55de0-7356-4328-86a8-3cef24731e96" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00002">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00002">
          <para id="para-00008">Correct! 1 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
          <para id="para-00009">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00010">The correct answer is: 1 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_3e35319d-0d6b-4438-b898-a83eb4302848" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00003">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00003">
          <para id="para-00012">Correct! 49 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
          <para id="para-00013">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00014">The correct answer is: 49 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_9dad8fdb-86ab-4fc5-91d4-2374565cfed6" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00004">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00004">
          <para id="para-00016">Correct! 4 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
          <para id="para-00017">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00018">The correct answer is: 4 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_76a7bb49-df6b-4f07-9e91-fa1907096032" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:munder><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mspace width="0.278em"/></m:mrow><m:mo accent="true">―</m:mo></m:munder></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00005">
          <para id="para-00020">Correct! 144 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
          <para id="para-00021">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00022">The correct answer is: 144 can be added to make the expression a perfect square.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_1a8021f2-29b7-460c-a547-5ada95fee16f" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00006">
          <para id="para-00023">If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is factored to be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, what is the missing value of the factored form of this expression? Remember to include the sign.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00006">
          <para id="para-00024">Correct! -3</para>
          <para id="para-00025">Try again. Revisit activities 9.2.2 and 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00026">The correct answer is -3.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="d27cd74b-c244-438d-95bf-926db14292d5" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00007">
          <para id="para-00027">If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is factored to be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, what is the missing value of the factored form of this expression? Remember to include the sign.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00007">
          <para id="para-00028">Correct! +1</para>
          <para id="para-00029">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.4.</para>
          <para id="para-00030">The correct answer is +1.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_34d2148f-1960-4081-8dd9-f3562a759993" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00008">
          <para id="para-00031">If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is factored to be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, what is the missing value of the factored form of this expression? Remember to enter the sign.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00008">
          <para id="para-00032">Correct! +7</para>
          <para id="para-00033">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.2.</para>
          <para id="para-00034">The correct answer is +7.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_0caa8b15-aa41-4a47-895e-6465577e9e88" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00009">
          <para id="para-00035">If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is factored to be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, what is the missing value of the factored form of this expression? Remember to enter the sign.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00009">
          <para id="para-00036">Correct! -2</para>
          <para id="para-00037">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.2.</para>
          <para id="para-00038">The correct answer is -2.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="c08b5393-28bf-4e98-96e0-02d1f5945809" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00010">
          <para id="para-00039">If <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is factored to be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, what is the missing value of the factored form of this expression? Remember to enter the sign.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00010">
          <para id="para-00040">Correct! +12</para>
          <para id="para-00041">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.2.</para>
          <para id="para-00042">The correct answer is +12.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <para id="para-00043">For each equation in questions 11 - 14, use the following scenario.</para>
      <para id="para-00044"><quote id="quote-00001">Jada looks at Mai's work and is confused. She doesn't see how Mai got her answer.</quote><quote id="quote-00002">Complete Mai's missing steps by answering the questions to help Jada see how Mai solved the equation.</quote></para>
      <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00046"><emphasis>Step 1 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00047"><emphasis>Step 2 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00048"><emphasis>Step 3 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00049"><emphasis>Step 4 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>±</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00050"><emphasis>Step 5 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00051"><emphasis>Step 6 -</emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.278em"/><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi><m:mi>_</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <para id="para-00052"><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> or <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
      <exercise id="daff277b-a353-4044-96ee-ad9ea59081f8" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00011">
          <para id="para-00053">What is the missing term in Step 1?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00011">
          <para id="para-00054">Correct! 36</para>
          <para id="para-00055">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00056">The correct answer is 36.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_27ace37f-eb5a-468d-97a5-f15cc4b7470f" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00012">
          <para id="para-00057">What is the missing term in Steps 4, 5, and 6?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00012">
          <para id="para-00058">Correct! 7</para>
          <para id="para-00059">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00060">The correct answer is 7.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="c07dfbfc-4a8b-4a72-91ec-f847b6fad843" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00013">
          <para id="para-00061">What is the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> in Step 5?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00013">
          <para id="para-00062">Correct! 1</para>
          <para id="para-00063">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00064">The correct answer is 1.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="c88b63c7-9f5e-4680-8d0e-da4c7639548c" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00014">
          <para id="para-00065">What is the value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> in Step 6?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00014">
          <para id="para-00066">Correct! -13</para>
          <para id="para-00067">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00068">The correct answer is -13.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <para id="para-00069">For questions 15 - 20, solve choose the equivalent equation with a perfect square on one side.</para>
      <exercise id="a68974c6-171a-48d6-8ba7-8ee9f75aedfa" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00015">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00071">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00015">
          <para id="para-00078">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00079">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00080">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_69d3ec36-966a-47c0-9312-eb11834874ef" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00016">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00082">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00016">
          <para id="para-00089">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00090">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00091">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="e21c7ba8-89c4-44ee-815e-7ba383005675" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00017">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00093">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00017">
          <para id="para-00100">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00101">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00102">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_38c7644a-a7e8-4d2f-9bd0-dcf06b374b59" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00018">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00104">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00018">
          <para id="para-00111">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00112">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00113">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_802db0f9-423e-49e8-a434-b7ddff12b747" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00019">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00115">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00019">
          <para id="para-00122">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00123">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00124">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="c20e168d-e932-42c0-a244-a690ebff838c" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00020">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00126">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00020">
          <para id="para-00133">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00134">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00135">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <para id="para-00136">For questions 21-23, solve each equation by completing the square, then choose the <emphasis>two</emphasis> roots.</para>
      <exercise id="_01ba74f0-4495-49ae-a6f3-b852b9226b0d" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00021">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00021">
          <para id="para-00138">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00139">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00140">The correct answers are: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_026ea025-d407-4e51-ad91-854415e91c82" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00022">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00022">
          <para id="para-00142">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00143">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00144">The correct answers are: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="cc4974dc-f7ef-4f80-b674-84e87c241f3c" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00023">
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00023">
          <para id="para-00146">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00147">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00148">The correct answers are: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="b1e1f763-6ea6-46bd-8a02-8cd017f9bc9b" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00024">
          <para id="para-00149">Solve the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>60</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> by completing the square.</para>
          <para id="para-00150">Multiple Choice:</para>
          <para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>78</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
        <solution id="sol-00024">
          <para id="para-00156">Correct! <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00157">Try again. Revisit activity 9.2.3.</para>
          <para id="para-00158">The correct answer is: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
